{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50380","headline":"湘潭偶题诗 · 褚遂良","name":"湘潭偶题诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远山酋萃（友人蒋礼垗同志谓当作「𡺚崒」\n）翠凝烟，烂漫桐花二月天。\n游徧九衢灯火夜，归来月挂海棠前。\n（此诗载《槐庐丛书》、《金石录补》卷二十二。\n《全唐诗续补遗》卷一据《佘山诗话》录此诗，今删去。\n首句「酋萃」二字，《佘山诗话》正作「𡺚崒」，与蒋说合\n明陈继儒《妮古录》卷一谓宋咸淳中邑令赵必穆於池中得断碑，上刻此诗。\n首句二字亦作「𡺚崒」\n录此诗後云「余皆莫辨」。\n）（〖1〗《槐庐丛书》、《金石录补》按此爲褚遂良贬潭州都督时所作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚遂良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}